Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:59.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.87,0:01:14.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:19.92,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:26.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.09,0:01:31.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:35.18,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:38.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.47,0:01:44.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:48.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:51.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:57.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:02:00.39,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:08.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:14.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:26.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊緊地抱住逞強的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:29.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就連難過的側臉　全部
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:31.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓·人·心·愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.35,0:22:35.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,每打破障壁都會變強的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:41.47,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼·睛　沒有不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:46.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,過於率直的心中的情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:50.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是不會輸給任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:55.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會放開你　不管在什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:23:00.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這看不到結局的一切　由我來改變
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:05.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,惡魔和天使都有翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:10.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,指引著前往更高的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:15.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再讓你的笑容變得陰沉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:21.83,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連結的希望　現在撕裂了黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.83,0:23:24.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:30.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}向著明天飛躍　Break Your Destiny
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  正式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…唔  可以了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:10.94,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,為了保護隱私而改變了聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  攝影機在拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天是期待已久的遠足
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家從早上開始就雀躍不已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在到家之前都是在遠足
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  老師說了巧克力是禁止帶的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就毀滅證據
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.15,0:00:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特別是明石同學她們三人  興致非常高漲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…  似乎是對這次遠足非常的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  你太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我封口費
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到…沒想到居然會變成那個樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(730,570)\fad(500,500)}33rd sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(780,600)\fad(500,500)}「秋日遊玩！午餐盒在草叢中」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  這是我們第一次遠足
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且小薰…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰還有另外一個第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回想起那個時候的薰的臉就感到很難過
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便當呢  可以吃便當了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  東野
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不要和我說吃的東西  我很容易暈車的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  真不像樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要這樣  明石同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  東野…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本做的便當  還熱呼呼的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同樣的事你從早上開始做幾次了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.14,0:03:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打開後大失所望我也不管的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米飯的旁邊貼著一張寫著「小菜自己去買」的紙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  前一天晚上三人都拜託皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望他在遠足的時候為自己做件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.15,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}遠足前夜  都內某公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔  總結一下每個人的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵是米飯和色彩繽紛的小菜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我媽媽做的小菜全都是茶色的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗是豪華的三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要超市的麵包
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是料還是麵包都要花心思哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼薰呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常勁的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃一口後嘴巴裡會射出光線
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背景會變成宇宙空間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會成為一生的回憶或者精神創傷？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成為精神創傷那就不好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是內心之傷痛的意思哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之就是這樣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:03:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼才做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西要修行好幾千年才有可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  我隨便做點好了  你不要抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.07,0:04:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨便的我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的媽媽是藝人  沒有生活能力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我沒有吃過親手做的便當
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:19.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是飯館的外賣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼隨便點就更加沒什麼問題了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要茶色的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  要盡全力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被提出不合理的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使如此還是不斷努力的精神的痛苦可是最棒的調味料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是空腹或者愛情啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在演戲吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你其實最喜歡活人的血吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:52.02,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}在那約十三小時之後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生是那個時常跟你們在一起的大哥哥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴著眼鏡的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:04:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們和他是什麼關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…情人？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙你的騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我們共同的親戚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是遠親
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在將來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有成為一家人的可能性哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在還未成年嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,認真的  她們是認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我也和皆本先生打過招呼的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實很帥氣  看起來也很溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且很聰明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是天才精英啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,運動也在行的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真是  這真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人希望他早死的類型啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好  我也想要那樣的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼苦的東西你居然喝的下去啊  哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  你妨礙我工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒不如說希望他現在就能消失掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯  如果憎惡能夠使人消失的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛  東野你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著拿石頭扔我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.87,0:06:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有這樣的動靜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了不是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊看啊  皆本那傢伙料理也是相當拿手的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也分點給千里你吧  愛情便當
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎  好期待
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那個時候事件…正確說來是事故發生了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那個真的只是稍微開下玩笑而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是有惡意才做的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿  到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去拿嗎  瞬移過去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:06:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力如果被看到的話可不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等會突然出現也很不自然
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正既然是皆本先生的話  應該做了很多的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們分點給她…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貝…貝果三明治？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖…雖然我覺得不太可能  小葵你的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.45,0:07:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小…小薰  不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生雖然嘴上說麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但還是好好地做了三人份的不同的便當
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我去撿回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明石同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.01,0:07:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我們遲到了的話  你們就幫我們糊弄過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人的話就能使用超能力的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是阻止他的話會引起懷疑的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們到山頂上等他們吧  千里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然薰和他在一起  不管是熊還是懸崖崩塌都不需要擔心的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本以為能夠馬上找到便當的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是不知為何  完全找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼找不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  還是放棄尋找  回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午餐我會分你的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  你可以先回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能這樣做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管了  你就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再找一會
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果發生什麼事情的話  我一輩子都會有心裡陰影的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也會被千里殺死的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好  下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大雨中是沒辦法瞬移的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這來  那兩人渾身濕透的狀態下獨處？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像下得沒有看起來那麼大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒怎麼淋濕的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我用念力稍微阻擋了一些雨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是像這樣鬆散地使用是很消耗體力的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  肚子餓…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是什麼設施
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是蓄水用的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,門是電子鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法用鑰匙打開嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能在東野面前把它轟掉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通風口的柵欄脫落了  所以掉了下來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是沒辦法爬上去的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦  明石
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我累了  全都…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷…冷靜  明石
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把我的便當給你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去小賣店買點什麼吃吧  媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:10:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽  我現在非常冷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就在這裡吃午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各組組長清點人數向老師報告
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  小颯那傢伙真慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底在哪裡做些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會是被熊襲擊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還從懸崖掉落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是好不容易將瑪莉亞做的便當送到山頂來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  班長  歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雨馬上就要停了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我說所有人都在  真的沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是讓老師知道了  皆本先生到時候會很囉嗦的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雨停了就馬上去找他們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從剛才起我就無法和小薰聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒…沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我們失陪一下  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  我可是班長啊  是有責任的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是超能力者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是薰和東野是不可能的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人際關係是不存在絕對的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰最近的措詞有了微妙的變化  你有發覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？！  說…說起來之前和我是沒有什麼差別的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在好像漸漸被拉開了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說  她最近發育很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.47,0:11:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越…越來越性感了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:33.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野君是把小薰當作男性朋友的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣反而更加危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.45,0:11:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有一瞬間把小薰當成女人的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什麼嘛  真下流
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別…別說傻話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼會對你這種…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.39,0:12:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很…很冷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才…才不冷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跟我客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我對你沒有什麼意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後小薰也察覺到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然覺得不可能  但是這說服力是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你媽媽料理很爛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這居然是你第一個便當  太誇張了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來你是真的喜歡皆本這人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺…現在對他撒嬌讓我覺得開心的不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗和葵也是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又如何啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很喜歡千里的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…並沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實以前她對我用了心靈感應
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果我真的對她發火了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想總有一天要向她道歉的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我發那麼大火真是對不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早點說出來不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定會很開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼做得到啊  這麼害羞的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.13,0:13:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼所謂嘛  說吧說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  說出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛好像聽到什麼聲音了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖啊  快點  就在這下面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地下？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像埋有什麼大型建築物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  最近的年輕人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是帶薪休假就是請病假
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢不聽我的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對國寶的監視是無時無刻都必要的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遠足也不例外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會是為了今天而特意建造的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}不…不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,認識的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  是完全不認識的大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  便當
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉在電梯的縫隙裡了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局…不  大叔是原因？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我什麼也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部不予回答
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身為負責人的你到底在說些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道就是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於這個設施的事情請保密…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是災難啊  你肚子餓了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我開動…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:14:59.53,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,香蕉可以算作點心的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}かわいいな　明石{\r}\N真可愛啊  明石
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}ブッとばす{\r}\N揍飛你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.44,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,樹木的果實能算作點心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:05.68,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}すごく　すごく…{\r}\N非常  非常…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最初我是打算馬上就撤的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到會引起那樣的騷動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:18.65,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}P.A.N.D.R.A基地  早上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真難吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,選錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  兩位
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L好像建造了新的秘密設施
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真木弟弟讓我去探察下情況
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能幫幫忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是送外賣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.30,0:15:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們送可疑物品來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下…下流的思考
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然在那種地方戴耳環
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:47.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打不中就沒有任何意義的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怎麼行啊  大媽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:53.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你了  局長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪啊  穿著這個應該會變透明的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是那個秘密設施？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是為什麼在這種地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會是為了監視這次遠足才…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是吧  那個猩猩局長是很有可能這麼做的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  和普通人這麼親密
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼那種傢伙是我們的女王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著拿石頭扔我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊看啊  皆本那傢伙料理也是相當拿手的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也分點給千里你吧  愛情便當
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎  好期待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛情便當嗎  說起來那個眼鏡的料理…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是蔬菜  要吃蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.19,0:16:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的味覺變遲鈍了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃太多重口味的東西和刺激物了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要好好記住素材的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在想來  那比泡麵要好吃多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:10.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便當嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  住手  不要做出一副要吃的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會溫柔地全吃光的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊  薰的便當啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要吧  你這Loli控
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要  至少讓我吃一口
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎大人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿  到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是拚命地尋找卻找不到便當
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著薰和小鬼跑下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼找不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  這裡是剛才的那個秘密基地附近吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好  下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點穿上雨衣  不然會淋濕的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  那些孩子氣氛很不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想讓京介來看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像下的沒有看起來那麼大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒怎麼淋濕的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像那樣鬆散地使用超能力是很累人的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呀  擔心了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為…為什麼我要！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通風口？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是笨手笨腳啊  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追上去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.30,0:18:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你媽媽料理很爛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你在摸哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是啊  在戳我哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這噁心的小鬼頭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早點說出來不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定會很開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼做得到啊  這麼害羞的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼不好啊  說吧說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  說出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛好像聽到什麼聲音了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是災難啊  你肚子餓了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.11,0:19:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  澪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我開動…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個便當我收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怪我們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便當
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者  The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便當  便當  真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三人一起問候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然被邀請了那就不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:37.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把便當還我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.55,0:19:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓你逃跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肌肉  接住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK  包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要品嘗鉛嵌入蛋蛋的衝擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是免了吧  小桃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空惡魔鼯鼠接球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣要怎麼飛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個小鬼真的發火了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我們並不是逃跑  我們一點都不害怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是戰略性撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正任務已經完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小桃  快點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.93,0:20:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我記住  下次碰面的時候我一定會讓你不得好死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次也說過同樣的話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這次真的要開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:31.43,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,要求不要太過分
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.59,0:20:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘記在她的背包裡放便當了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讓她在下面等我  自己送過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.99,0:20:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們擔心了  真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以上  報告結束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是災難啊  小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:21:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吸取教訓  今後就乖一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時禁止你出島
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本那笨蛋都能做到  你以為我會做不到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少…少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也用不著如此認真來對抗吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.51,0:21:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太不成熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  只有你一個人吃  太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也讓我吃一口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.67,0:21:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊  這是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了你太不成熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說誰不成熟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛痛痛  真木兄說的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別聽他扯淡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這幫傢伙全都是笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不想被你說！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.61,0:21:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那個  我這次有犯什麼錯誤嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:49.56,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有  順其自然就…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大家辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  慢著  這算什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.86,0:22:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還真是不成熟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.41,0:22:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天會碰到好事的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  你在哪裡啊  大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人類們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.14,0:23:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的時代結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今後將是我們蒼蠅的時代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗被蒼蠅憑依了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.32,0:23:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那是紫穗的真心話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想吃大便
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.67,0:23:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.87,0:23:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.46,0:24:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第34話  「朝蠅暮蚊！皆本用手還是用腳？！」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:05.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來好美味啊  想要吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.51,0:24:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

